<title>UNITED NATIONS: Four Iraq oil contracts &quot;under consideration&quot; - UN.</title>
<headline>Four Iraq oil contracts &quot;under consideration&quot; - UN.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four contracts related to UN-approved Iraqi oil sales aimed at raising money for food and medicine in Iraq are now under consideration, according to UN spokeswoman Sylvana Foa.</p>
<p>Foa had no further immediate details, but did say more information on the matter would likely be released later today.</p>
<p>It was not immediately clear whether the four contracts now under consideration are the same four the UN turned back on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- New York Energy Desk +1 212 859 1633</p>
